{"3854540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Pinkman Files", "steam_appid": 3854540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4411970], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/extras/db05f78cef8a9d166fdade93a8494d0f.avif?t=1786525396\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Pinkman Files</strong> is a short, experimental game, with visual novel elements that focuses on giving <strong>YOU</strong> a worthwhile (funny) experience through a series of mini-games, fast paced turn based fights, and <i>addicting</i> ball rolling sections while its story keeps you hooked <strong>wanting for more</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Put your detective skills to work and find out just what the hell is even happening here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/extras/67804a9729378a843870c06ba954a7e5.avif?t=1786525396\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The story revolves around <strong>Pinkman</strong>, a young man that's just moved to <u>Uruguay</u> in search of a more relaxed life. <i>However...</i> shortly upon getting accustomed to the residents of this small town, it seems something much greater is being hidden from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Who really is telling the truth?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Well, that doesn't matter! You'll surely always be humoured all throughout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Maybe even giggle a bit...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/extras/9da31ae1ae58524ca56218505fd65d49.avif?t=1786525396\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fret not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For we've provided an entire <i>level editor</i> with <u>workshop</u> support for <strong>Rolamari</strong>! Our ball rolling mini-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are free to experiment in it however much you want to! Create stages to your hearts content and share them with the world! <i>And don't forget to try other players' stages with a click of a button...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Want even more?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All of <strong>The Pinkman Files</strong>' assets are available to you the moment you have it installed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you want to change the music, graphics, or even the code itself, you are free to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Have fun!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/extras/db05f78cef8a9d166fdade93a8494d0f.avif?t=1786525396\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Pinkman Files</strong> is a short, experimental game, with visual novel elements that focuses on giving <strong>YOU</strong> a worthwhile (funny) experience through a series of mini-games, fast paced turn based fights, and <i>addicting</i> ball rolling sections while its story keeps you hooked <strong>wanting for more</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Put your detective skills to work and find out just what the hell is even happening here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/extras/67804a9729378a843870c06ba954a7e5.avif?t=1786525396\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The story revolves around <strong>Pinkman</strong>, a young man that's just moved to <u>Uruguay</u> in search of a more relaxed life. <i>However...</i> shortly upon getting accustomed to the residents of this small town, it seems something much greater is being hidden from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Who really is telling the truth?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Well, that doesn't matter! You'll surely always be humoured all throughout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Maybe even giggle a bit...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/extras/9da31ae1ae58524ca56218505fd65d49.avif?t=1786525396\" width=960 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fret not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For we've provided an entire <i>level editor</i> with <u>workshop</u> support for <strong>Rolamari</strong>! Our ball rolling mini-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are free to experiment in it however much you want to! Create stages to your hearts content and share them with the world! <i>And don't forget to try other players' stages with a click of a button...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Want even more?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All of <strong>The Pinkman Files</strong>' assets are available to you the moment you have it installed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you want to change the music, graphics, or even the code itself, you are free to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Have fun!</strong></p>", "short_description": "The Pinkman Files is a mini-game rich, fast paced, turn based combat game with a side of visual novel, that will challenge your detective skills and allow you to uncover the secrets of a peculiar town.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/a13ebf1fe5cd5598eeb1a3e9631dbdacdfbde3a1/header.jpg?t=1786525396", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/01264355bc84504fcee81ab3a1f90af71d24bb25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786525396", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854540/01264355bc84504fcee81ab3a1f90af71d24bb25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786525396", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4430 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 or DirectX 11 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB ava